[1m[38;5;231mWhat tooling should we set up from the start?[0m

  [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;114m[✔][39m Node built-in test runner (Recommended)
  [38;5;246mnode:test + node:assert. Zero dependencies, matches the repo's no-deps character, gives TDD somewhere to run.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m [ ] Linting + formatting
  [38;5;246mAdd a standard linter/formatter (eslint+prettier, or biome). Small config, keeps style consistent.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m [ ] Jest or Vitest
  [38;5;246mHeavier test runner with a jsdom DOM environment built in. Adds real dependencies to a currently dep-free repo.[39m
  [38;5;246m4.[39m [ ] No tooling
  [38;5;246mWrite the code without test infrastructure. Fastest now, no safety net for the storage logic.[39m
